npm: astronomy-engine@2.1.19

Production astrology uses this library for geocentric ecliptic positions,
of-date declination (Rotation_EQJ_EQD), sidereal time, obliquity, and nutation.
The mean lunar node and mean lunar apogee are Horosa formulas from swemmoon.c
swi_mean_node and swi_mean_apog. They are not Astronomy Engine bodies.
Swiss Ephemeris is not a production dependency.
